 "why": "The cosine series has insulated edges; the series now uses the eigenfunctions of the convective edge (even cos and odd sin, lam tan(lam L/2) = beta, one beta = h_side sum(slab)/sum(S) for the layers, the perimeter of the real outline on a board with an outline), in the steady sheet, the tile Green function and the modal transient; it replaces the transfer of the edge loss to the faces (never released). The warning is now a rule on the shared parameter. Boards with h_side None are bit-identical."
